---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro'

const post = {
 title: 'Screen Printing in Las Vegas: How to Pick the Right Shop for Your Business',
 description:
 'Looking for a Las Vegas screen printing shop? Compare press capacity, ink chemistry, cure verification, garment selection, and current order terms before you approve production.',
 category: 'Local Guides',
 readTime: '8 min read',
 date: 'May 9, 2026',
 isoDate: '2026-05-09',
 image: '/images/og-default.jpg',
 slug: 'screen-printing-shop-las-vegas-guide',
}

const faqs = [
 { q: 'Where can I get screen printing near me in Las Vegas?', a: 'Bighorn Threads gets screen printing done for Las Vegas businesses. Share your design, product needs, quantity, and deadline. Your quote confirms available garments, ink method, minimums, and timing.' },
 { q: 'What\'s the difference between a commercial screen printing shop and a small-batch operation?', a: 'Commercial and small-batch shops may use different presses, cure systems, and quality controls. Equipment alone does not determine the result. Ask how registration, curing, and quality checks are handled for your garment.' },
 { q: 'How fast can a Las Vegas screen printing shop turn around an order?', a: 'Stock, quantity, artwork, colors, and proof approval drive the timing. Ask for the complete schedule and any rush cost in writing before approving the order.' },
 { q: 'What\'s the minimum order for screen printing?', a: 'Your quote lists the minimum for the garment, artwork, and colors. Bighorn confirms the current minimum, setup fees, quantity breaks, and timing in your written quote.' },
 { q: 'What kind of ink does a screen printing shop use?', a: 'Plastisol and water-based inks are two options to compare. The fabric, artwork, and cure process decide which inks work. Ask for the approved ink and the manufacturer instructions on your order.' },
 { q: 'How do I send a design to a screen printing shop?', a: 'Send the best source art you have and identify each placement, size, and garment color. Get accepted file formats, art charges, and proofing terms in writing.' },
 { q: 'Can a screen-printing partner decorate hi-vis apparel?', a: 'The employer must select the exact garment. Before production, obtain current manufacturer and employer approval for the proposed decoration method, materials, and placement. Do not assume decoration preserves a rating.' },
]

const schema = {
 '@context': 'https://schema.org',
 '@graph': [
 { '@type': 'Article', headline: post.title, description: post.description, image: `https://bighornthreads.com${post.image}`, datePublished: post.isoDate, dateModified: '2026-08-21', author: { '@type': 'Organization', name: 'Bighorn Threads', url: 'https://bighornthreads.com/' }, publisher: { '@type': 'Organization', name: 'Bighorn Threads', logo: { '@type': 'ImageObject', url: 'https://bighornthreads.com/images/logos/bighorn-logo-color.png' } }, mainEntityOfPage: `https://bighornthreads.com/blog/${post.slug}/` },
 { '@type': 'BreadcrumbList', itemListElement: [{ '@type': 'ListItem', position: 1, name: 'Home', item: 'https://bighornthreads.com/' }, { '@type': 'ListItem', position: 2, name: 'Blog', item: 'https://bighornthreads.com/blog/' }, { '@type': 'ListItem', position: 3, name: post.title, item: `https://bighornthreads.com/blog/${post.slug}/` }] },
 { '@type': 'FAQPage', mainEntity: faqs.map((f) => ({ '@type': 'Question', name: f.q, acceptedAnswer: { '@type': 'Answer', text: f.a } })) },
 ],
}

const speakableSchema = {
 '@context': 'https://schema.org',
 '@type': 'WebPage',
 url: `https://bighornthreads.com/blog/${post.slug}/`,
 name: post.title,
 speakable: {
  '@type': 'SpeakableSpecification',
  cssSelector: ['h1','.speakable-answer'],
 },
}
---

<BaseLayout title={post.title} description={post.description} canonical={`https://bighornthreads.com/blog/${post.slug}/`} ogImage={post.image} type="article" publishedDate={post.isoDate}>
 <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(schema)} />
 <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(speakableSchema)} />
 <article class="bg-concrete">
 <header class="border-b border-hairline bg-paper">
 <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 pt-16 pb-12 sm:px-6 sm:pt-20 lg:px-8">
 <nav class="mb-6 font-mono text-xs text-ash" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/" class="hover:text-gold-600">Home</a><span class="px-2">/</span><a href="/blog/" class="hover:text-gold-600">Blog</a></nav>
 <span class="kicker mb-3">{post.category}</span>
 <h1 class="mb-6 font-heading text-3xl font-extrabold uppercase leading-tight tracking-tight text-charcoal sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl">{post.title}</h1>
 <p class="mb-8 text-xl leading-relaxed text-ash">A practical guide to picking a Las Vegas screen printing shop for your crew, business, or event. Compare equipment, process controls, and current order terms.</p>
 <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-4 gap-y-2 border-t border-hairline pt-6 font-mono text-sm text-ash"><span class="text-gold-600">Bighorn Threads Team</span><span aria-hidden="true">&middot;</span><span>{post.readTime}</span><span aria-hidden="true">&middot;</span><time datetime={post.isoDate}>{post.date}</time></div>
 </div>
 </header>
 <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-16 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">

 <aside class="mb-10 border border-hairline bg-panel p-7">
 <p class="mb-3 font-mono text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-gold-700">Quick Answer</p>
 <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-charcoal sm:text-xl speakable-answer">Pick a Las Vegas screen printer by asking how it cures ink, how it proofs a job, and whether it will put the date in writing. A wash test on a sample shirt will tell you more than a price list.</p>
 </aside>

 <h2 id="commercial-vs-garage" class="mt-12 mb-4 font-heading text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-charcoal">Commercial vs Garage Screen Printing</h2>
 <p class="mb-6 text-lg leading-relaxed text-charcoal">Not every screen printing operation is built to handle business work. The split:</p>
 <ul class="mb-6 list-disc pl-6 space-y-3 text-lg leading-relaxed text-charcoal">
 <li><strong>Small-batch shop:</strong> Often runs manual presses and can be flexible on short runs. Ask how it keeps colors lined up and checks the cure.</li>
 <li><strong>Commercial shop:</strong> Automatic presses and a conveyor dryer. This is usually the fit for crew orders and repeat runs.</li>
 <li><strong>Contract printer:</strong> Built for big counts. Expect higher minimums and less hand-holding.</li>
 </ul>

 <h2 id="evaluation" class="mt-12 mb-4 font-heading text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-charcoal">What to Evaluate When Picking a Shop</h2>

 <h3 class="mt-8 mb-3 font-heading text-xl font-bold text-charcoal">1. Press type</h3>
 <p class="mb-6 text-lg leading-relaxed text-charcoal">Ask whether your job runs on a manual or automatic press and how the shop keeps colors lined up. Big equipment doesn’t guarantee your date, so get that in writing.</p>

 <h3 class="mt-8 mb-3 font-heading text-xl font-bold text-charcoal">2. Cure tunnel + verification</h3>
 <p class="mb-6 text-lg leading-relaxed text-charcoal">The ink and the garment set the cure process, following the ink maker instructions. Ask how the partner monitors and documents cure. Washing and drying affect print life too.</p>
 <p class="mb-6 text-lg leading-relaxed text-charcoal">Ask how the shop checks cure on your ink and shirt, and ask for washing instructions you can pass to your crew.</p>

 <h3 class="mt-8 mb-3 font-heading text-xl font-bold text-charcoal">3. Ink chemistry</h3>
 <p class="mb-6 text-lg leading-relaxed text-charcoal">Plastisol and water-based inks can produce different looks and hand feels. The fabric, artwork, and cure process decide how it performs. See our <a href="/blog/plastisol-vs-water-based-ink-workwear/" class="text-gold-700 underline decoration-gold-500/40 underline-offset-4 hover:decoration-gold-600">plastisol vs water-based</a> piece for factors to compare.</p>

 <h3 class="mt-8 mb-3 font-heading text-xl font-bold text-charcoal">4. Blank garment availability</h3>
 <p class="mb-6 text-lg leading-relaxed text-charcoal">Ask if your shirt, color, and sizes are in stock now, and what the shop will do if one runs out.</p>

 <h3 class="mt-8 mb-3 font-heading text-xl font-bold text-charcoal">5. Color separation + art capability</h3>
 <p class="mb-6 text-lg leading-relaxed text-charcoal">Ask who prepares separations, what art charges to expect, and whether the shop keeps your screens or files for a reorder.</p>

 <h3 class="mt-8 mb-3 font-heading text-xl font-bold text-charcoal">6. ANSI 107 hi-vis compliance</h3>
 <p class="mb-6 text-lg leading-relaxed text-charcoal">If you print on hi-vis, ask how the shop checks the garment maker’s instructions. Ink over the wrong area can affect the rating. See our <a href="/blog/ansi-107-class-2-vs-class-3-hi-vis-las-vegas/" class="text-gold-700 underline decoration-gold-500/40 underline-offset-4 hover:decoration-gold-600">ANSI 107 planning guide</a>.</p>

 <h2 id="vegas-context" class="mt-12 mb-4 font-heading text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-charcoal">Vegas-Specific Screen Printing Demand</h2>
 <p class="mb-6 text-lg leading-relaxed text-charcoal">Vegas shops print for trade crews, conventions, and hospitality teams, and convention dates don’t move. Ask about rush capacity before show season.</p>

 <h2 id="industries" class="mt-12 mb-4 font-heading text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-charcoal">Common Vegas Industries Served</h2>
 <ul class="mb-6 list-disc pl-6 space-y-3 text-lg leading-relaxed text-charcoal">
 <li><a href="/industries/general-contractors-las-vegas/" class="text-gold-700 underline decoration-gold-500/40 underline-offset-4 hover:decoration-gold-600">General contractors</a>: crew tees and hi-vis</li>
 <li><a href="/industries/concrete-masonry-las-vegas/" class="text-gold-700 underline decoration-gold-500/40 underline-offset-4 hover:decoration-gold-600">Concrete and masonry crews</a></li>
 <li><a href="/industries/roofing-solar-las-vegas/" class="text-gold-700 underline decoration-gold-500/40 underline-offset-4 hover:decoration-gold-600">Roofing and solar crews</a></li>
 <li><a href="/industries/landscaping-las-vegas/" class="text-gold-700 underline decoration-gold-500/40 underline-offset-4 hover:decoration-gold-600">Landscaping and grounds maintenance</a></li>
 <li>Event organizers, conference crews, music festivals</li>
 <li>Restaurants, retail brands, and small businesses</li>
 </ul>

 <div class="mt-12 border border-hairline bg-panel p-7 sm:p-9">
 <h2 class="mb-3 font-heading text-2xl font-extrabold uppercase tracking-tight text-charcoal">Looking for a screen printing shop in Las Vegas?</h2>
<p class="mb-5 text-lg leading-relaxed text-ash">Bighorn Threads supplies commercial screen printing. Send your art and count for a price and a proof.</p>
 <a href="/services/screen-printing-las-vegas/" class="btn-primary text-base">See Our Screen Printing Service →</a>
 </div>
 </div>
 </article>
</BaseLayout>
